cmd-spawnchemfire-desc = Spawns a chemical fire of the given prototype on the tile you are standing on.
cmd-spawnchemfire-help = Usage: spawnchemfire <chemical fire prototype id>
cmd-spawnchemfire-invalid-args = Expected exactly one argument: the chemical fire prototype id.
cmd-spawnchemfire-no-entity = You need to be attached to an entity to run this.
cmd-spawnchemfire-invalid-prototype = No entity prototype with id "{ $prototype }" exists.
cmd-spawnchemfire-failed = Failed to spawn the chemical fire. Are you standing on a grid, and does that prototype have a ChemicalFire component?
cmd-spawnchemfire-prototype-completion = <chemical fire prototype id>
